*> vybe-test: cobol/intrinsics_string/test_intrinsics_trim_modes
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_intrinsics_string.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-STR PIC X(10) VALUE "  hello   ".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STR LEADING).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STR, LEADING) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "hello   "
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [hello   ] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STR TRAILING).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING FUNCTION TRIM(WS-STR, TRAILING) DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "  hello"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [  hello] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

